  <circuit name="demo-scaled-math">
    <comp lib="0" loc="(118,294)" name="Callout">
      <a name="background" val="#fbfc0280"/>
      <a name="dx" val="-36"/>
      <a name="dy" val="-31"/>
      <a name="foreground" val="#d15c5a"/>
      <a name="text" val="click to plot"/>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(149,168)" name="Callout">
      <a name="dx" val="45"/>
      <a name="dy" val="53"/>
      <a name="foreground" val="#8f726e"/>
      <a name="text">Changes from unsigned [0, 4096]
to signed [-2048, 2047] scale.</a>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(17,22)" name="Text">
      <a name="halign" val="left"/>
      <a name="text">Demonstration of the audio "Scaled Math" feature. Click one of the buttons in the mux to choose
which function you want to plot, then click bang.

The counter sweeps from 0 to 4096, and that gets shifted to signed range [-2048, 2047], before
being fed into five different functions, and one of them is sent to the screen for display.

The other circuitry is used to stop the counter and plotting when it overflows. </a>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(259,509)" name="Callout">
      <a name="dx" val="-52"/>
      <a name="dy" val="-55"/>
      <a name="foreground" val="#8f726e"/>
      <a name="text">This SR Latch s "set" to 1 when the
counter overflows, and "reset" to 0
when bang is pressed.</a>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(394,355)" name="Callout">
      <a name="background" val="#fbfc0280"/>
      <a name="dx" val="-52"/>
      <a name="dy" val="-55"/>
      <a name="foreground" val="#d15c5a"/>
      <a name="text" val="select one to display"/>
    </comp>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(581,315)" name="Callout">
      <a name="dx" val="-52"/>
      <a name="dy" val="-55"/>
