  <circuit name="SVF-filter">
    <a name="appearance" val="custom"/>
    <appear>
      <rect fill="none" height="60" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" width="70" x="50" y="50"/>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" fill="#404040" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="10" text-anchor="start" x="79" y="100">Q</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="top" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="72" y="50">SVF?!?</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="77" y="71">filter</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" fill="#404040" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="10" text-anchor="start" x="59" y="100">f</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="59">hp</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="108" y="79">bp</text>
      <text dominant-baseline="central" font-family="SansSerif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="108" y="99">lp</text>
      <circ-port height="8" pin="190,580" width="8" x="56" y="106"/>
      <circ-port height="8" pin="250,210" width="8" x="46" y="76"/>
      <circ-port height="10" pin="770,230" width="10" x="115" y="55"/>
      <circ-port height="8" pin="180,650" width="8" x="76" y="106"/>
      <circ-port height="10" pin="780,380" width="10" x="115" y="75"/>
      <circ-port height="10" pin="780,430" width="10" x="115" y="95"/>
      <circ-anchor facing="east" height="6" width="6" x="117" y="57"/>
    </appear>
    <comp lib="0" loc="(20,31)" name="Text">
      <a name="halign" val="left"/>
      <a name="text">Resonant State-Variable Filter (SVF), with outputs for LP, BP, and HP.
Params:
  f = 2 * sin(something) = between 0 and +2. We will use 16 bit unsigned, and map that full range to [0, +2]
  Q = 0.5... 10   so we will use 16 bit unsigned, and map that rull range to [0.5, 10]
Formulas:
  hp = x - lp - (1/Q)*bp
  bp += f * hp
  lp += f * bp</a>
    </comp>
